0qcEdSuEs1S9qhvI.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Retire","category":"battle","text":"如果我能再冷静一点的话……","text_original":"うーん、もう少し落ち着いてできていれば……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/QzxUWMtKr95NlGsTphmEJjToRiaUSJr6.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"え","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/u7GJAtuATumU6fU7sUPHmeG4dsd67pNg.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はぁ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/WLynMIRwuz8c9HBpQlZxvZPSOtWQ8QMG.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"や","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/a70wvZT3Z40AmFawQ81OdcWXsJYeBUjs.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_TacticalAction_1","category":"battle","text":"开始移动。","text_original":"移動します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fmdaehaajShZB2fUSNEahk6WlGhoPBwg.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_TSA_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ここからは、容赦しないから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/UDYswiv5cqCA3G7qxMTCnVjcrYnsiX8a.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_TSA_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"覚悟して、本気で行くよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ToquS36ZfFG3blH9Da00hwGFGx20yFnW.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"通关。我们去下一关吧。","text_original":"クリア、次のステージに移動しましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/t1TNR8wUtcq0YxX7AES3aNdvqmUFzOc5.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Battle_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我们胜利啦！","text_original":"私たちの勝利です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/7EgANvNbHhBKbcqx48gNpugU65vrFDKI.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"拜托……来吧……来吧……耶，出货啦——！","text_original":"お願いだから……出て……出て……出た！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/NcLpZU8gdGZRMTesURXc6pEOmFJGvuAA.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"很好。保持下去……过啦！","text_original":"よし。このままいけば……クリア！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/l1FIpdPZwU1WsHjCfRqYB048SHjq6Tms.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"诶……这个游戏，有点意思。","text_original":"へえ……このゲーム、面白い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/zeIy24UjSfuXspxk8tZS0FiFa9Yp6yzS.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔……听说这个游戏的续作出了……好，去打工吧！","text_original":"うーん、あのゲームの続編が出たらしいけど……よし！アルバイトしよう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/oiq2OeeDw6TJKtd1oxJRpaCwu8IDdAZE.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"等我再长大一点……要不要把头发留长呢。","text_original":"もう少し大人になったら……髪を伸ばしてみようかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/7DooN9MflV23OwG9cglp0IzHlyKFZh7y.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"唉，输了，没办法了！","text_original":"はーあ、負けた。仕方ないね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/NNKfzw0dYRalBv5ixiJsWklZETJJEHgJ.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"有点不甘心……那，就试试看吧！","text_original":"少し悔しい。さて、やってみようか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/YQxZIW5GNQt0rcc121kcf858xcCXLM0m.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"唉，愿赌服输。","text_original":"うん……約束は約束だから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Mru4yz7cxKhLNM4U9Kn3SclZK75b5QXG.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"别怪我，这只是工作。","text_original":"恨みはないけど、覚悟して。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/nrnsC90HlMrPB1QXITJgR23F0uodJpTX.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"和画像素图一样，精细一点。","text_original":"ドットを打つように緻密に……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/v1t7SHvtu5BS0G5cNdz4w0CXCAS3iIHe.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"连续射击，我要上了！","text_original":"連続射撃、行きます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/sKcMGWkDN0asz6xKwOXntu5urQ2J86Vn.ogg"},{"description":"获得专武","category":"other","text":"不知道用“漂亮”这个词来形容武器合不合适……不过我很开心。","text_original":"武器にこんな表現をするのは合ってるのか分かりませんが……美しいですね。嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/AdOkaCeEvBnbtO9uIdKNf95TDvE3OxKD.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"明白了，让我来吧。","text_original":"分かりました。私が行きます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/3NQfnvqMKGARK26bvCLvSfvDFmBBVDMR.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"好，好的，我会尽力做到最好！","text_original":"あ、はい。ベストを尽くします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/NxFr7btkDG6z9Alq1dvx7dmf32R4e0bx.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Formation_Select.ogg","category":"formation","text":"唔——哈？！","text_original":"うーん……あれ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/zdbXrrERnakA0gg9J7f1GZmrYMV573VD.ogg"},{"description":"获得学生","category":"other","text":"我会用最棒的操作手法来帮助老师的。","text_original":"最高のプレイで先生をお手伝いしますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/RDatEJBndzcO5vKeKHYl7rznEYOdONLq.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我想画得够好，也希望能给老师帮上更多的忙。","text_original":"絵も上手になりたいし…先生のお役にも立ちたいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/dJmhoR7YAq48VRJngRcsbNFYmOZI6YBC.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"努力得到回报，真的是一件很开心的事。","text_original":"努力が報われるのは本当に嬉しいことです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ygU8LicL8lvGqpzMiMXwI9JKb93u6zk2.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我想变得更成熟。这样应该就能给大家，还有老师，带来更多的帮助了。","text_original":"もっと大人になりたいです。そしたらもっとみんなや、先生の……力になってあげられるはずだから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/sytqmkLCqLwoC3WEyW4viVVzcJ1SkdeB.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，以后我也会全力以赴。","text_original":"ありがとうございます、先生。これからも…ベストを尽くします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/343as51655NeqaQwcSpakgipALqrzWIr.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"好担心游戏开发部的小伙伴们啊。 虽然我跟老师在一起……还挺开心的。","text_original":"ゲーム開発部の子たちが心配ですね。 私は先生と一緒にいるから……いいですけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/zBgs8ULM7HBAwMaSWrXj1FlO8eNG3P3Y.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师也玩过我们的游戏吧？您觉得哪些地方最有意思呢？","text_original":"あっ、先生もうちのゲームやってみたんですよね？どこが一番面白かったですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/isNaxvQUhoMiRzKnaLTXLD1yRWMXmwus.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我想画出更好看的作品所以……我需要积累丰富的经验。 老师……也会帮我的吧？","text_original":"もっと美しいものを書きたいです。そのためには……たくさんの経験が必要です。 先生も、手伝ってくれますか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/e1JQGwpk0YHFsdxP2PyM1guVA0vILTrv.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我在画画的时候追求的不只是“萌”，还想在其中倾注爱意。","text_original":"私は絵を描くとき、「萌え」だけではなく「愛おしさ」も込めたいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/r3v4fQSD7dOptAbTqLRaenybQbIz2fJg.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"呜啊——这个月的零花钱也快见底了…… 值日……会有工资的吧？！","text_original":"うーん。今月もお小遣いがギリギリ……。 当番の生徒になったら給料が出るんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/XPaV7mbkhXaq4paSzdfxQcYgQ1R5xjtu.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师好。今天也请您多多指教了。","text_original":"ようこそ、先生。今日もよろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ZdsatcK5Z9lQouFqfZpWFJGuTh7viSbd.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了和老师一起度过有意义的一天，我会全力以赴的。","text_original":" ベストを尽くします。先生と私の今日が、意味のある一日になるように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/pUxkFqU4kG21wSreOGZllSZYrq0fuAk4.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"在这之前，除像素风游戏，我对其他类游戏都不怎么感兴趣……","text_original":"今までドット絵のゲーム以外にはあまり興味がなかったんですけど……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ch4piIFfUdvzA9xXp5hKO0Tz6DyU9zTg.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"没想到，游戏厅还有这样的游戏啊！","text_original":"ゲームセンターにはこういったゲームもあるんですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/DEcI6TBajfXMSczNWj9D9pZPmBePgyCJ.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"感觉真的长了见识，又学到新东西了！","text_original":"視野が広がった気がします、勉強になりました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/kmzK5oAZO1hJkgvbP81TJz3WKpLKhiWc.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢老师，谢谢您……今天带我一起来这里……","text_original":" ……ありがとうございます、先生、ここに連れて来てくださって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/w5Wyp28r1JNsCk5JzGHb45KfwWSFW4u0.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以，所以我现在……真的超级开心！","text_original":"……そのお陰で私、今、すごく楽しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fg49PjnPOxUCuC4v0DNUdhvmXjGlnTlV.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，对了……","text_original":"あ、そうだ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Fv8psh5rSLsZe65q1CvpHEKEdWfiB5ju.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天的事，可不可以……对姐姐保密啊？","text_original":"今日のこと、お姉ちゃんには……内緒ですよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/A7fyak3nPMUsro6TWnfrGdKDHxH81AJ5.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_MemorialLobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"绝对，绝对要保密哦！","text_original":"絶対、絶対ですからね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/LYSRWNoz82k9S03CqiJjSYNxWcGmK5Kw.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师总是这么温柔。","text_original":"先生はいつも優しいですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/2XfXWHK1MdVTbOHowwIcP0UK2eOuSpxx.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"以后，也继续和游戏开发部一起，创造美好的回忆吧！然后，也和我……我，我什么都没说！","text_original":"これからもゲーム開発部と良い思い出を作っていきましょう。 そして、私とも……な、なんでもありません！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Esh3oTNiyZxH34c6BsZfxCmSD2sY5F4I.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"游戏做好以后，我想让老师第一个试玩！","text_original":"ゲームを作ったら、先生へ一番にお見せしたいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/1r7TUcqgby57eioXlNPjzmyEYtaOuNkh.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"偶尔，我也希望不是和姐姐一起，而是自己独占老师。嗯……可，可以牵您的手吗！","text_original":"たまにはお姉ちゃんと一緒にではなく、私だけで先生を独占したいですね。 あの……て、手を繋いでもいいですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/8SB55vgxp9fKcx4r1Qj8w83P45fk34Qi.ogg"},{"description":"学生生日","category":"other","text":"生日必须跟家人一起度过。 所以老师……可以陪我和姐姐……一起过吗？","text_original":"お誕生日は家族と一緒に過ごさなくちゃいけません。 お姉ちゃんと……先生も一緒に……いかがですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/RReevmrhH7asBcVBjYsgGidPV1JiKArN.ogg"},{"description":"玩家生日","category":"other","text":"老师，衷心地祝您生日快乐。 嗯，不过，我不知道您喜欢什么…… 要不要……跟我一起去挑呀？","text_original":"先生。心から、お誕生日おめでとうございます。 でも何が好きか分からなくて…… 一緒に選びに行きませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/tNPRGEm7Y42Q2PpmUFAg80nF7pt4Yiqa.ogg"},{"description":"万圣节","category":"other","text":"其实我不怎么喜欢万圣节，不过今年开始有老师和大家在…… 感觉会很开心，我很期待！","text_original":"ハロウィンはそんなに好きじゃないですけど今年からは、先生とみんながいるから…… 楽しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/djtqV36pRLI6Fszc4OEjqnOrjf127VgO.ogg"},{"description":"新年","category":"other","text":"新年快乐！新的一年也请多多关照！","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます。今年も一年、よろしくお願いします！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/YiDfybdKJkZmizrmMGgo4GDdGgiHUHTL.ogg"},{"description":"圣诞节","category":"other","text":"圣诞快乐！唔……据说今天是恋人们的专属节日。 我，我就是随口一说！","text_original":"メリークリスマス！その……今日は恋人たちの日らしいです。 た、ただそれだけです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/cOWUplclDgeXP8qz20dIrL3HWNXGmZkk.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"我好不甘心……","text_original":"くぅ……悔しい……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/5OBwznn2oVA3HXBE6zAEVSWGb00sMO5P.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"对不起，是我的实力不够。","text_original":"申し訳ありません。私の力不足でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/KEAF3OuApdVrQWY9LNEeyEuKGlSAOaZe.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"既然领了任务，就要好好干！","text_original":"引き受けたからにはしっかりとやります。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/5iMGXc9r9DT0PBXt1Zkr5o8vRqMy2TGx.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"冷静慎重地前进吧！","text_original":"落ち着いて、前に進みましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Sy2TEpiyvdjWKuZkFEZM7im985GKI576.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"各位，辛苦了！","text_original":"皆さん、お疲れ様でした！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Gd0YFjrLkpm9UV3jJvjoBxWI3kQc35jy.ogg"},{"description":"Midori_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"通关，太棒了！","text_original":"クリア、素晴らしいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/2mPWRFIEIi06cGonDVLljOE8ZW5FUP7R.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"midori_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"子弹擦过去了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/NheZfGvxeOREm3fz3knLDJiIWtFHtTQP.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"派对游戏的基本，是团队合作哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/CcQHFS3QHu6w2n3mHcKl8kpOdHRao8Lt.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"啊，这种事情，其实姐姐更擅长的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/5whEjQzMpKpvUGKWbEgS9JtCtezpsqz9.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"前进！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/6MYuKUZHGa0SU3miTkiZSmPyJa7sGT6m.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"好想早点回去玩游戏……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/WWEVc3zSMXGPTW56lyF6qruqWkJBNSzL.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"谢谢您的支援。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/sPOozCVph6fgZ5L69jiimhOy9gFIPkPi.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"如果我能再冷静一点的话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/yyQFpou2JLBY2DvKrqiWIbQYS7qEil6O.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/xxBATWJwHZOa1Y0qJGtwGEEWN2lBQyGO.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/iWtQaoHLZFoX7lqy0e9nX3XcXLJHNGKX.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/33dLxoIMvxb6lDsktrsZa9dHMGg8balA.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"开始移动。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/esMdKXX75zm2ARoPLylyrNEPTb6X8y3E.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"通关。我们去下一关吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fBtyjRk4ejidCmitcrttBHHQ3MuY1X5g.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我们胜利啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/as7vEMWtMiibX4JmyDn25jS6c8ECsa4L.ogg"},{"description":"midori_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"拜托……来吧……来吧……耶，出货啦——！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/cjZsixhzBFmXdnemTEqC8yMi12lwB57s.ogg"},{"description":"midori_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"很好。保持下去……过啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/niOFuHZom0WktjdWnMxpOPLv4UR9e0Mw.ogg"},{"description":"midori_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"诶……这个游戏，有点意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/RxwBXXJojOp2GZ7aeUM7DB3062dsEnmB.ogg"},{"description":"midori_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"唔……听说这个游戏的续作出了……好，去打工吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/nGOT8p0c69Be9RsYeOva2irDFz7OKSLx.ogg"},{"description":"midori_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"等我再长大一点……要不要把头发留长呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/vMSrcyUuY7uXwMPI1KFhkhs1XSdD97H1.ogg"},{"description":"midori_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"我来帮忙。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/BlLnhYE0rs1cOdH6apQxisONCkTUXD3p.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"唉，输了，没办法了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/uhICXF7EphbAfQYkfUUF2hDl3JwwOJiR.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"有点不甘心……那，就试试看吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/kDBDk0mOiNAoRaXYDVyKfmL3li2rwVvm.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"唉，愿赌服输。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/UKU5pPdIhguZrTaSc6CIYAk0DtFBCRSz.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"别怪我，这只是工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Snj2NeiYBVDt8u7rZH1j2veIuiJxEXTj.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"和画像素图一样，精细一点。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/VOptWuei9DAc4MyHyXrIAMG9sTTcRhpW.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"连续射击，我要上了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/giBvPN6QxrlAqAYp3Bj0mNB5D2MGZgWb.ogg"},{"description":"midori_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"不知道用“漂亮”这个词来形容武器合不合适……不过我很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fccH7VHqCzz4ocKPkHaJpSOvJZROAaVo.ogg"},{"description":"midori_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"明白了，让我来吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/B9OHSQcOFljUPnnW8MrRvvLgwYdCLqOm.ogg"},{"description":"midori_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"好，好的，我会尽力做到最好！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/HSY4fgX5LYGFu155g4SEEDaj0ckavpQb.ogg"},{"description":"midori_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"唔——哈？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/xULTEYbmHyDxNPvK7Lh0qKfpuZ4qxM34.ogg"},{"description":"midori_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我会用最棒的操作手法来帮助老师的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/40oTKF5b0DbJ1SVfUzi2vEsGoSuK8Ljh.ogg"},{"description":"midori_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我想画得够好，也希望能给老师帮上更多的忙。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/9aVsuaNi906d0Iif52KpR0fgSkMVCIuW.ogg"},{"description":"midori_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"努力得到回报，真的是一件很开心的事。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/VbvP1Bhsc3vOldvUMyaE6aM8gdBpFXgL.ogg"},{"description":"midori_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我想变得更成熟。这样应该就能给大家，还有老师，带来更多的帮助了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/qYKPtuZqJbV9K1SJVhRripGKIwxBK4KE.ogg"},{"description":"midori_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，以后我也会全力以赴。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/sZuh8VOmAJxiC0A2frX0s05yZ8rMH2x1.ogg"},{"description":"midori_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"好担心游戏开发部的小伙伴们啊。 虽然我跟老师在一起……还挺开心的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/xgBTz0ujmjQ9udeOyHFAiITraXvrC5tQ.ogg"},{"description":"midori_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师也玩过我们的游戏吧？您觉得哪些地方最有意思呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/BQEgMIpsOo3yRoyPfkI8LUSMoohCBLh9.ogg"},{"description":"midori_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我想画出更好看的作品所以……我需要积累丰富的经验。 老师……也会帮我的吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/zCQ006vLr26AXMrun9HlNWb3x3o586V0.ogg"},{"description":"midori_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我在画画的时候追求的不只是“萌”，还想在其中倾注爱意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/KBngl7sTPDDeeqqQs8GhGrlDe4Si7lQk.ogg"},{"description":"midori_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"呜啊——这个月的零花钱也快见底了…… 值日……会有工资的吧？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/xpkbg4XjbxSwC350thS7MuVN7R5xAE4b.ogg"},{"description":"midori_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师好。今天也请您多多指教了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/n4XieUBVKxw6N8yobsaHjahlT6xV9vZi.ogg"},{"description":"midori_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了和老师一起度过有意义的一天，我会全力以赴的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/6ampP3Gxuc9gCBWRZ5gNxevWVQp9oY4X.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"在这之前，除像素风游戏，我对其他类游戏都不怎么感兴趣……没想到，游戏厅还有这样的游戏啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/2blPaf50ZBE3YN2E6pwLXiom1ghKcwkh.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"在这之前，除像素风游戏，我对其他类游戏都不怎么感兴趣……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/7qI3pYwqPhmDaDwoS2hTK4LMPTO1gpDx.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"没想到，游戏厅还有这样的游戏啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ixutsHgrQ6QCwoAvXWciVhTp9Y2quEEe.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"感觉真的长了见识，又学到新东西了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/d9YWzlvYyEhDZLsvmPLHuWyGUBy74D5P.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢老师，谢谢您……今天带我一起来这里……所以，所以我现在……真的超级开心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/MyjAaeODuroRty1cVoJXEXSGmWPy8ibx.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢老师，谢谢您……今天带我一起来这里……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/4TI7qKQVQwOttxOZe19GoiXbeOA8aAJI.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以，所以我现在……真的超级开心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Fu3fdU4yuj6hWbdOmCN5kOyk1fd5zmvo.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"啊，对了……今天的事，可不可以……对姐姐保密啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/SwVjwxuNkh8NRVKe5lQyvAjYBcVGIyFb.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，对了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/VV3ww9n0f0EW2Ja91OwWsMhNGKhWLsom.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天的事，可不可以……对姐姐保密啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ca3eaGlGSvJ79mX87C7iD8RstevC54Qn.ogg"},{"description":"midori_memoriallobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"绝对，绝对要保密哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/iUIL4TCBTcAys6nCYB6rHpWHJaYH3UuS.ogg"},{"description":"midori_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师总是这么温柔。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/bGflFgrqpKjZioZF8nAfPfpLMRJaUG6p.ogg"},{"description":"midori_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"以后，也继续和游戏开发部一起，创造美好的回忆吧！然后，也和我……我，我什么都没说！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/8FEpy2uzRA3QzMpOWKoLu4UyheEI3b4h.ogg"},{"description":"midori_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"游戏做好以后，我想让老师第一个试玩！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/XCIBhKledAPZv6TenRpUK5uceiDacUn6.ogg"},{"description":"midori_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"偶尔，我也希望不是和姐姐一起，而是自己独占老师。嗯……可，可以牵您的手吗！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/E8Qrl9Kq9jtf42YQYcDPWaBZiddubtlS.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"生日必须跟家人一起度过。 所以老师……可以陪我和姐姐……一起过吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/YscYjwDwqxoUClT9K16yfmpKLjdcSBPe.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，衷心地祝您生日快乐。 嗯，不过，我不知道您喜欢什么…… 要不要……跟我一起去挑呀？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/hgTu9IgPp3MVikrrXoFjQPtU2CiJIm1A.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，新春快乐！希望新的一年也能和游戏开发部的大家一起，创作出更有趣的游戏！然后，要是还……还有老师一起，就更好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/EuffklO1eZ4d3T31HXN09mQts6alUsLh.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"其实我不怎么喜欢万圣节，不过今年开始有老师和大家在…… 感觉会很开心，我很期待！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/cdWBYbckiieJVe3sQhqLmHSbJV8mD22G.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"中秋节到了，今天是和家人团聚的日子呢。我和姐姐打算一起吃吃月饼打游戏，老师，您，您要不要加入呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/7RGoAGP1oHku8CsNsmJrcp59225C4Fhj.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！新的一年也请多多关照！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/7AypUeKMndQhZpxH1U7DK5QBseRAcYjl.ogg"},{"description":"midori_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐！唔……据说今天是恋人们的专属节日。 我，我就是随口一说！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/vXxQNT6ZZ6igIYG5i2wu9eM9qWJd7wIt.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"我好不甘心……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/ojaJw5MUbLTyikDkfiX0m1AJGedewSfU.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"对不起，是我的实力不够。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/qUeW1ilAdX6dD4Gpr2AEynZreHIwVDw3.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"既然领了任务，就要好好干！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/AD8WdWq2ZleDbr2xWriIjcdsSnYLzVq6.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"冷静慎重地前进吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/U3UgXGAzeT65JZWRito3eDe9pd6uncKZ.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"各位，辛苦了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/Qzr2dFdUIdBbbDWeO2K2NUCHGZxFQWMc.ogg"},{"description":"midori_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"通关，太棒了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/RUIhT5KFiLiKOG2NfGNAmz2s1k8ic2h8.ogg"},{"description":"midori_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/3tz5PsdHIXeblwb8kVMkJu3xytarSoWh.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"非常感谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fi0jYZNu5WlToZUvzcQPxcJMp4QUTXfT.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/fuRtxT3og2cNgopnZ099EE3QpyG7Bgy0.ogg"},{"description":"midori_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"就躲在这里吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%20%E7%BB%BF/8T2XYJlFByLhbItM4nQEBCU4AXjChavS.ogg"},{"description":"midori_bat